# {{packageName}}

<!-- Badges go here, in the standard's order: registry version, Tests, Static
     analysis, License MIT -- but only the ones whose claim is true for THIS
     repository. A registry badge for a package the registry does not have
     renders as a broken "invalid" pill while asserting the package is
     installable, and a CI badge on a private repository answers 404 for every
     logged-out reader. Add a one-line note under them saying why any of the
     four is absent, so the next reader does not restore the count. -->

> {{humanName}} icons for the Ichava Laravel icon ecosystem.

Requires [`ichava/core`](https://opensource.simtabi.com/documentation/ichava/core/); targets PHP `^8.4.1 || ^8.5` on Laravel `^13`.

## Install

```bash
composer require {{packageName}}
php artisan ichava::ichava-core.database seed --package={{packageName}}
```

The seed is not optional — until it runs the registry holds no rows for this pack and every lookup returns nothing.

This pack's configuration is registered by `laranail/package-tools` from the provider's `hasConfigFile()` call; see core's [configuration guide](https://opensource.simtabi.com/documentation/ichava/core/configuration) for publishing and overriding it.

